'''Soul''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that was originally obtainable by purchasing it individually from the Soul Gamepass for 1,699 Robux or from the Spirit & Soul Bundle for 3,399 Robux during the [[Halloween Event 2024|2024 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has ended.

== Appearance ==
Soul is is a white and grey revolver similarly shaped and designed like [[Hallowgun]]. Grey wood-like splinters creep along the barrel and handle. Underneath the splinters on the handle, it appears to be wrapped mummy-like in a light ash color. 

== Trivia ==
* It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife [[Spirit]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Spirit Set|Soul Set]].
* This and its partner knife are two of the eleven gamepass weapons where you had the option to buy them as part of a bundle or separately, the others being [[Pearl]], [[Pearlshine]], [[Flowerwood]], [[Flowerwood Gun|Flowerwood gun]], [[Darkshot]], [[Darksword]], [[Waves]], [[Ocean]], [[Rainbow (Godly)|Rainbow]], [[Rainbow Gun (Godly)|Rainbow Gun]], [[Sakura]], [[Blossom]], [[Phantom]], [[Spectre]], [[Plasmablade]], [[Plasmabeam]], [[Iceflake]], and [[Icebeam]].

